This is the wb900 Workbench disk.

Demos holds Hello, a Workbench tool: double-click it.  Notes and this
file are projects that More, in Utilities, shows.  In More, Space and
Backspace page, the cursor keys scroll, F finds, N and P find the next
and previous match, J jumps to a line, E opens the file in Edit and Esc
quits.  Edit, also in Utilities, is a text editor.  Show All Files in
the Window menu shows the files and drawers that have no icons.
